usage: astra [-h]
             {version,doctor,config,experiment,db,camera,perception,interaction,activity,procedure,assurance,mission,voice,ml,dataset,model,sim,simulation,stream,events,ground-monitor,benchmark,demo,final-check,competition-check,deployment,physical-test,hil,flight-package,rehearsal,dress-rehearsal,rehearsal-scorecard,training-mode,maintenance,hardening,edge,qualification,verification,system-test} ...

ASTRA-EA — Autonomous Spacecraft Experiment Assurance & Assistance CLI

positional arguments:
  {version,doctor,config,experiment,db,camera,perception,interaction,activity,procedure,assurance,mission,voice,ml,dataset,model,sim,simulation,stream,events,ground-monitor,benchmark,demo,final-check,competition-check,deployment,physical-test,hil,flight-package,rehearsal,dress-rehearsal,rehearsal-scorecard,training-mode,maintenance,hardening,edge,qualification,verification,system-test}
                        Available subcommands
    version             Print system version and status
    doctor              Run system diagnostics and environment checks
    config              Configuration management
    experiment          Experiment procedure operations
    db                  Database management
    camera              Camera device management
    perception          Perception subsystem operations
    interaction         Interaction subsystem operations
    activity            Activity recognition subsystem operations
    procedure           Procedure assurance and step recognition operations
    assurance           Assurance engine and viewpoint robustness operations
    mission             Mission operations: precheck, export, report, review,
                        console
    voice               Audio guidance and voice assistance operations
    ml                  Machine learning runtime diagnostics
    dataset             Dataset Studio operations
    model               Model development, training, evaluation, and registry
    sim                 Simulation & Fault Injection platform
    simulation          Simulation & Fault Injection platform (alias)
    stream              Video streaming management and diagnostics
    events              Ground telemetry event operations
    ground-monitor      Launch the Qt Ground Monitor console
    benchmark           End-to-end benchmarking, latency profiling, and
                        endurance soak
    demo                One-command interactive flight demonstrator
    final-check         Run comprehensive 14-subsystem pre-demonstration audit
    competition-check   Run official SIH competition readiness verification
    deployment          Deployment readiness and health diagnostics
    physical-test       Run physical test rig validation
    hil                 Hardware-in-the-Loop testing engine
    flight-package      Flight-integration build packaging and validation
                        (Phase 18)
    rehearsal           End-to-end mission rehearsals across operational modes
                        (Phase 20)
    dress-rehearsal     Execute full-length dress rehearsal with zero
                        developer intervention (Phase 20)
    rehearsal-scorecard
                        Compile and display consolidated rehearsal scorecards
                        (Phase 20)
    training-mode       Operator training mode and operational failure drills
                        (Phase 19)
    maintenance         Maintenance mode manager and subsystem diagnostics
                        (Phase 19)
    hardening           Findings-driven hardening, RCA, and release candidate
                        gating (Phase 21)
    edge                Edge compute diagnostics, benchmarks, and validation
    qualification       Spacecraft qualification readiness and systems
                        engineering
    verification        Formal Verification & Validation framework
    system-test         Execute complete system validation test suite and
                        manual checklist

